  rule out the need to broadcast:

  * `operator.matmul(x)` is `O(D1*...*Dd*N*R)`
  * `operator.solve(x)` is `O(D1*...*Dd*N*R)`
  * `operator.determinant()` is `O(B1*...*Bb)`

